tSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b25" target="b19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e45" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1.25;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b26" target="b24"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t46" value="tải model mỗi phiên" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1652" y="698" width="140" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="z47" value="&lt;b&gt;Luồng chính&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="820" width="860" height="124" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t48" value="① thu thập tài liệu công khai, ghi sources.csv&lt;br&gt;② đẩy chunks, catalog, từ điển lên Drive&lt;br&gt;③ push code, config, benchmark&lt;br&gt;④ clone repo đầu mỗi phiên Colab&lt;br&gt;⑤ embed chunks → vectors/vN" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="72" y="852" width="420" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t49" value="⑥ kéo vectors, upsert Qdrant dev trên WSL&lt;br&gt;⑦ chạy B0–B4 trên dev/test → runs/&lt;br&gt;⑧ kéo runs: metric, Ragas, phân tích lỗi&lt;br&gt;⑨ demo trong buổi bảo vệ (video quay sẵn làm dự phòng)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="496" y="852" width="410" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="z50" value="&lt;b&gt;Nguyên tắc&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fdf1f0;strokeColor=#b85450;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="940" y="820" width="870" height="124" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t51" value="• Chỉ tài liệu công khai và dữ liệu giả rời khỏi laptop; không đưa dữ liệu nội bộ lên Drive, Colab, Gemini.&lt;br&gt;• Repo public chỉ chứa code, config, benchmark, kết quả; GEMINI_API_KEY trong .env, không commit.&lt;br&gt;• Số liệu báo cáo lấy từ lần chạy trên Colab L4 cho cả B0–B4; meta.json ghi GPU, version Ollama, digest model.&lt;br&gt;• Tinh chỉnh min_score, top_n từ điểm rerank đã ghi trong log, không chạy lại GPU." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="956" y="852" width="840" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="2._Pipeline_B4_và_nơ" name="2. Pipeline B4 và nơi chạy"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="8" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1500" pageHeight="980" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="t1" value="Pipeline B4: kho tri thức dựng trên WSL, embed trên Colab; mỗi câu hỏi chạy trọn trên Colab GPU" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="18" width="1420" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t2" value="Màu = nơi chạy khi lấy số liệu báo cáo. Khi debug, cùng code chạy được trên WSL (CPU) với Qdrant Docker. Dòng nghiêng = cấu hình bật bước đó." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="52" width="1420" height="24" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="z3" value="&lt;b&gt;Offline · xây kho tri thức, chạy lại khi tài liệu hoặc chunking đổi (data_version)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="96" width="1452" height="250" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b4" value="&lt;b&gt;Tài liệu công khai&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;quy tắc, điều khoản,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;bảng phí, bảng quyền lợi&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="144" width="196" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b5" value="&lt;b&gt;Parser&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;Docling + OCR,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;bảng → Markdown&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="276" y="144" width="196" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b6" value="&lt;b&gt;Chunker + metadata&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;B1: cố định 512 token&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;B2+: Điều/Khoản, bảng&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="512" y="144" width="196" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b7" value="&lt;b&gt;Embed tài liệu&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;bge-m3 fp16&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;dense + sparse&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="748" y="144" width="196" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b8" value="&lt;b&gt;vectors/vN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;trên Drive,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;1 bộ cho mỗi data_version&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="984" y="144" width="196" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b9" value="&lt;b&gt;Qdrant&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;local mode trên Colab;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;Docker trên WSL khi debug&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="144" width="196" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b10" value="&lt;b&gt;Catalog + từ điển 2 cấp&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;catalog.json, glossary.json&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;stro